    {
      "_key": "ad2wlcy8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "griyaquj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Midjourney’s Character Reference: The Anchor Method"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Lovart is the AI design agent trusted by 10M+ creators. "
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ctaLink"
          ],
          "text": "Try Lovart Free →"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "ctaLink",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.lovart.ai"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_type": "cta",
      "link": {
        "_type": "link",
        "external": "https://www.lovart.ai/features/ai-business-card-maker",
        "label": "Business Cards →",
        "type": "external"
      },
      "style": "action-outline"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4ahbj5ci",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3vzmtryi",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Midjourney’s approach is direct and image-centric. It relies on providing the AI with a visual “ground truth.”"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a8itf3px",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "foylyq60",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How It Works:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "zb61wz5j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A user uploads an image of their character (a portrait, ideally). They then use the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "xyrost64",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "text": "--cref"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ko0f9ipj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " parameter along with the image URL in a new prompt. The AI attempts to extract the facial features, hairstyle, and sometimes basic attire from the reference image and apply them to the new generation."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "gzpvnsln",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "uvya61n4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Strengths:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "23mr8lin",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "aceghcwb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Direct Visual Fidelity:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "17sjoj7k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " For a close match to a specific, existing artwork or photo, this method can be very effective. It directly maps visual patterns."
        },
        {
          "_key": "z90ykodj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "kb8oxm0d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Simplicity:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "n2sbduv1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The workflow is straightforward: have a good reference image, use the parameter."
        },
        {
          "_key": "2vxbmxdv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "y5hkmx0y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ngleyayt",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "43jz89i9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Limitations and Challenges:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xu3jvj4q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "s91v1dif",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The Rigidity Problem:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "czlg59tz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The reference acts like a stiff template. If the new prompt describes a very different pose, expression, or lighting (e.g., “the character laughing in bright sunlight” vs. the reference’s neutral expression in studio light), the AI struggles. It may produce a face that is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "vkndco7r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "structurally"
        },
        {
          "_key": "wyouln0o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " similar but fails to integrate the new contextual demands, resulting in an uncanny or pasted-on look."
        },
        {
          "_key": "g5tan4h5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "jma21xxl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Style Bleed and Contamination:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "rv9ut1kr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The reference image carries its own artistic style. If you try to generate the character in a different style (e.g., from an anime reference to a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "htx0dc1i",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "photorealistic"
        },
        {
          "_key": "53flvtli",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " scene), the AI often fails to separate the character’s form from the reference’s style, leading to a muddy hybrid."
        },
        {
          "_key": "9gp0ovd0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bpvcbebf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Lack of Semantic Understanding:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "phv82f5t",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The system sees pixels, not concepts. It doesn’t understand “Detective Aris’s weary determination.” It only tries to match the arrangement of light and dark areas from the reference. This makes it poor at maintaining a character’s "
        },
        {
          "_key": "v2cevj8p",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "essence"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bgrzwl4s",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " across varied emotional states."
        },
        {
          "_key": "xdnocxog",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2o23h7xe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Dependency on a Single Image:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e4dqfigb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The quality of all future generations is tied to the quality and specificity of that one reference image. A poorly lit or ambiguous reference dooms the entire project.\nIn essence, Midjourney’s method is excellent for producing variations "
        },
        {
          "_key": "15k1ozb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "of a specific image"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2i4zm314",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", but struggles with evolving a character "
        },
        {
          "_key": "zwph29q2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "within a story"
        },
        {
          "_key": "sc5gxw23",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        },
        {
          "_key": "9mgpkheb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "rp4322gy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "zs87nlzo",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "uwrmh9fe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Lovart & Nano Banana: The Systemic Governance Method"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "awtzsrzu",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "j4xuubiz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Lovart’s approach, especially when utilizing a model with the anticipated capabilities of "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4msfgnl8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Nano Banana 2 (NB2)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "70l8m6uf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", is holistic and system-based. Consistency is not achieved by locking onto one picture, but by adhering to a defined set of rules and relationships."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "yg0qusdy",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b7sics6z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How It Works:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "i53bmf9k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Consistency is built through layered, conversational governance:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vudavgxt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "yaspfgbb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Semantic Character Definition:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "537hx43s",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The character is first defined as a set of persistent traits in the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "qp1btjmp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "ChatCanvas"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ct36x638",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " dialogue. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "uzmpihn3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "“Character: Detective Aris. Key traits: sharp jawline, thin vertical scar over left eyebrow, cool blue eyes, greying hair at temples, a permanent expression of weary intelligence.”"
        },
        {
          "_key": "azxomkwd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This definition becomes a recurring reference point ."
        },
        {
          "_key": "mlntshiv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ehybmtik",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Style System Enforcement:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gwtl7wgk",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A top-level style directive governs all outputs. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a6w2m7lt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "“Series Style:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cc4j4uq6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "whc44eyp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em",
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cinematic"
        },
        {
          "_key": "q8d2obxc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4kd1ev7l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "noir, high contrast,"
        },
        {
          "_key": "r54jkheg",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "6rb8ktvs",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em",
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "shallow depth of field"
        },
        {
          "_key": "auougnf8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "**, desaturated color grade with pops of amber.”"
        },
        {
          "_key": "wb6e9y2y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " This ensures all images, regardless of content, share a unifying visual language that the character exists within ."
        },
        {
          "_key": "w1v0pa1l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9ov2bzqy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Relational Prompting:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "zkn18gm0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " New scenes are described relationally to the character. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0b4vt4ky",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "“Generate a scene where Detective Aris, under the harsh light of a streetlamp in the rain, examines a clue.”"
        },
        {
          "_key": "49zltngo",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The prompt assumes the defined “Detective Aris” and places him into the new context, relying on the AI’s ability to maintain the core traits."
        },
        {
          "_key": "k4lnkrme",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9llnld2o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Asset Reuse with Edit Elements:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "uhq2mivz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The most powerful tool for absolute consistency. Generate a perfect character portrait once. Use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "dagih9si",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Edit Elements"
        },
        {
          "_key": "x4zlndat",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to get a flawless cut-out. This digital standee becomes a reusable asset. For new scenes, generate backgrounds and composite the character asset onto them. This guarantees 100% visual consistency for the character’s likeness, as it is the same digital file placed into different environments . This method, combined with "
        },
        {
          "_key": "prtbcoh3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Touch Edit"
        },
        {
          "_key": "uvu9h9k4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for contextual adjustments (adding rain to the coat, changing expression slightly), offers unparalleled control."
        },
        {
          "_key": "vns1vz8z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3rhg0gja",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "pqiacu5e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "alt1ja9m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The Consistency Test: A Narrative Scenario"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c8ifo2rd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3vmnuzi4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Let’s test both methods on a narrative sequence: generating a consistent character across three keyframes: 1) A determined close-up, 2) A shocked reaction, 3) A relaxed, pensive moment."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fxlf655w",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2qujmt96",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Midjourney (Character Reference) Workflow:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ufcsdhhd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "sa3fwd0x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Create or choose a good reference image of “determined face.”"
        },
        {
          "_key": "sd21nxjg",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "tc793kgs",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "y07phvrr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "text": "--cref"
        },
        {
          "_key": "n664k1yu",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to generate the “determined close-up.” Result: Good match."
        },
        {
          "_key": "hbdncmga",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ocd83ltm",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use the same "
        },
        {
          "_key": "r6c5e58n",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "text": "--cref"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ntp12dxn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to generate the “shocked reaction.” Result: The face structure holds, but the expression may look forced, and the lighting from the reference may clash with the new “shocked” scene lighting. The character feels like a mask placed in a new setting."
        },
        {
          "_key": "q5c2q3as",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6xs5ac9p",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use the same "
        },
        {
          "_key": "co1bk665",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "text": "--cref"
        },
        {
          "_key": "mnf6lack",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to generate the “relaxed, pensive moment.” Result: Significant drift likely. The AI’s attempt to render relaxation may override the reference’s determined bone structure. The character’s core “weariness” is a semantic concept the system doesn’t grasp, so it may be lost."
        },
        {
          "_key": "mhb4foab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vz08lfk2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "60va2s1o",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "201wmgba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Lovart (Systemic Governance) Workflow:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8i6sbjin",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "17fze67z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Define the Character & Style:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7tbomw3l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Establish the semantic traits and series style in the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "15ritg8i",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "ChatCanvas"
        },
        {
          "_key": "z6xom7tu",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        },
        {
          "_key": "8g20bmx8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e3eylxe3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Generate Keyframe 1:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "zxnbay7r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Prompt for the determined close-up within the defined system."
        },
        {
          "_key": "7dwn8vuk",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5khpv4a5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Isolate the Asset:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1t7vyloa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "jbk8sway",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Edit Elements"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ackhe7c7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " on the best result to create a perfect character cut-out."
        },
        {
          "_key": "id6cnd61",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gcn42hm0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Generate Backgrounds & Composite:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vviugu8t",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " For Keyframe 2, generate a background for the “shocked reaction” scene. Place the character asset onto it. Use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ujlc7el2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Touch Edit"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cqq532v3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to adjust the character’s expression to “shocked” while keeping the base face identical. For Keyframe 3, repeat: generate a pensive background, place the character, adjust expression to “pensive/relaxed” ."
        },
        {
          "_key": "uf1ox2u2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "adxqxn9b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Result:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "rgsv6a1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A three-image sequence where the character is visually identical in form, but convincingly displays different emotions. The world (lighting, setting) changes dramatically, but the character remains a stable, recognizable entity throughout. This is true narrative consistency."
        },
        {
          "_key": "j5irpwrf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "rpc4ibyu",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ptgl6gv1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2vj1ewdr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The Verdict: Different Tools for Different Goals"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0pkvp711",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "pglet7cm",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Midjourney’s Character Reference"
        },
        {
          "_key": "lrazb6ph",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is a powerful tool for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e2k2xiy1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "visual repetition"
        },
        {
          "_key": "17vy75yl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". It excels when you need multiple images that closely resemble a single source portrait, with relatively minor variations in pose or expression. It is like a very sophisticated rubber stamp."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "r7z8z6kv",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5admbc3t",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Lovart’s approach, particularly with asset-based workflows powered by models like Nano Banana"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vkb8bj8r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", is designed for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1jpiqdgd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "narrative coherence"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vr9ztv80",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". It excels when the character must inhabit a changing world, display a range of emotions, and remain believably the same person throughout. It is less about stamping a face and more about directing an actor who understands their role and can perform it in any scene you set ."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "km7lu1z2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ly6vo40r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Conclusion: Beyond the Face, Towards the Role"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Related: "
        },
